PHASE 2 — DNS Structure (Do This Cleanly)

In Cloudflare → DNS:

Add:

Type	Name	Points To	Proxy
A	api	VPS_IP	🟠 ON
A	app	VPS_IP	🟠 ON
A	admin	VPS_IP	🟠 ON
A	@	VPS_IP (or redirect to app)	🟠 ON
CNAME	cdn	your-r2-public-url	🟠 ON

Make sure all are orange cloud.

PHASE 3 — SSL Configuration

Go to:

Cloudflare → SSL/TLS

Set:

Full (strict)

Then:
Enable:

Always Use HTTPS

Automatic HTTPS Rewrites

Do NOT leave it on Flexible.

